{"sourceUrl":"https://xxgcxy.gdut.edu.cn/info/1210/8709.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:06.509991+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://xxgcxy.gdut.edu.cn/info/1210/8709.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>广东工业大学是一所以工为主、工理经管文法艺结合</span></span><span><span>，多科性、</span></span><span><span>协调发展的省属重点大学、广东省高水平大学重点建设高校。信息工程学院拥有</span><span>“信息与通信工程”和“光学工程”两个博士学位授权点，“电子信息”专业学位博士点（新一代电子信息技术及光电信息工程领域）及“信息与通信工程”博士后流动站。其中，信号与信息处理为广东省重点学科，具备“本科</span><span>-</span><span>硕士</span><span>-</span><span>博士</span><span>-</span><span>博士后”完备的人才培养体系。学科研究方向涵盖了信息论、无线通信、光通信、通信网络、信号处理、电子信息、集成电路、光电器件、人工智能等信息领域。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院现有专任教师</span></span><span><span>103</span></span><span><span>人，其中教授</span><span>31</span><span>人、副教授</span><span>46</span><span>人。教师队伍中，拥有国家杰青</span><span>2</span><span>人、教育部特聘教授</span><span>1</span><span>人、国家优青</span><span>5</span><span>人、海外优青</span><span>1</span><span>人、其他国家级人才</span><span>2</span><span>人，广东省“珠江人才计划”创新团队</span><span>2</span><span>个、广东省领军人才</span><span>2</span><span>人、各类省级人才</span><span>12</span><span>人。师资队伍年轻化，</span><span>45</span><span>岁以下占</span><span>59.2%</span><span>。学缘结构多元化，</span><span>82.5%</span><span>的教师来源于海内外知名高校。国际化程度高，</span><span>80%</span><span>的教授具有海外留学和国际知名企业工作经历。学院现有全日制在校学生</span></span><span><span>3077</span></span><span><span>人，其中博士生</span><span>73</span><span>人、硕士生</span><span>689</span><span>人。我院研究生就业率</span><span>/</span><span>就业平均薪资一直名列学校前茅，</span><span>2016</span></span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span>2019</span><span>年最终就业率均为</span><span>100%</span><span>，</span><span>2020</span></span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span>2025</span><span>年最终就业率均超过</span><span>97%</span><span>，就业单位包括华为、荣耀、腾讯、大疆、电网、中国移动、联通、电信、珠海格力电器、三星通信等知名单位。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>近五年来，学院承担国家和省部级项目</span><span>170</span><span>余项，包括国家重点领域研发计划项目</span><span>4</span><span>项、重大科研仪器研制项目</span><span>4</span><span>项、国家自然科学基金重点项目</span><span>5</span><span>项、国际重点合作项目</span><span>2</span><span>项，纵向经费超</span><span>2.3</span><span>亿元，</span></span><span><span>横向项目</span>168<span>项，横向经费超</span><span>5180</span><span>万元；发表</span><span>SCI</span><span>论文</span><span>529</span><span>篇（中科院</span><span>2</span><span>区以上</span><span>316</span><span>篇）；获授权发明专利</span><span>563</span><span>件；多次获广东省科学技术一等奖、广东省科学技术二等奖等省部级以上科研奖励</span></span><span><span>。学院拥有一系列省部级以上科研平台，包括教育部重点实验室</span><span>1</span><span>个、省重点实验室</span><span>2</span><span>个（其中</span><span>1</span><span>个为联合共建）、省级协同创新中心</span><span>1</span><span>个、省级工程中心</span><span>7</span><span>个、省级国际合作基地</span><span>2</span><span>个、省级实验教学示范中心</span><span>2</span><span>个。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院注重与国外高校进行科研合作、人才交流，已先后与新加坡南洋理工大学、新加坡国立大学、英国曼彻斯特大学、英国伦敦大学学院、英国艾塞克斯大学、澳大利亚悉尼大学、澳大利亚新南威尔士大学、香港大学、香港理工大学、香港城市大学、香港科技大学、日本同志社大学等开展了科研合作，并定期选派优秀研究生到合作机构进行交流。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为促进高校间优秀大学生的交流，近距离了解广东工业大学信息工程学院学术环境及科研平台，培养从事科学研究的兴趣，并鼓励优秀大学生在我院深造攻读研究生学位，广东工业大学信息工程学院拟举办</span><span>“广东工业大学信息工程学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动，活动相关安排如下，欢迎同学们踊跃报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>、活动时间</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>初步安排在</span>20</span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日举行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、活动内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>举办学术讲座或论坛、知名学者学术报告、科研团队介绍、参观校园、图书馆</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>团队实验室</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>科研平台</span></span><span><span>及相关企业</span></span><span><span>等</span></span><span><span>，并开展</span><span>2027</span><span>年硕士研究生招生政策宣传工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、申请条件及办法</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学生申请参加夏令营活动</span></span><span><span>须具备</span></span><span><span>以下条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>全国</span><span>2027</span><span>届电子信息类相关专业</span><span><span>的</span>20</span><span>27</span><span>届本科毕业生</span><span>以及本院低年级学业优异学生；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.2027</span><span>届</span></span><span><span>本科前三年学习成绩在所在专业年级排名居前</span>30%<span>，全国英语水平考试（非英语专业）四级成绩达到</span><span>425</span><span>分以上</span></span><span><span>（成绩特别突出者可破格申请参加本次夏令营）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>对学术研究有浓厚兴趣，基础扎实，创新能力强，愿意从事学术研究</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>身心健康，</span></span><span><span>具有</span></span><span><span>不畏</span></span><span><span>困难、敢于挑战、勇于创新和</span></span><span><span>勇往直前的精神。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span><span>报名方式及材料提交</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>参加本次夏令营活动的同学请一律在网上报名，申请人须于</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>24:00</span><span>之前，</span></span><span><span>登录广东工业大学信息工程学官网，下载打印附件</span>1<span>和附件</span><span>2</span><span>，并按照如下要求提交电子版材料到</span><span>ZHS@gdut.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>电子版材料按照如下顺序整合为</span>1<span>个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，并以</span><span>“202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年暑期夏令营</span>+<span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校名称</span><span>”</span><span>命名</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>过时</span></span><span><span>不予受理</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>纸质版</span></span><span><span>原件</span></span><span><span>报到时提交。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>《广东工业大学信息工程学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年（</span><span>2027</span><span>届）优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动申请表》</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>附件</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>，到所在学校相关部门填写意见并盖章，扫描电子版；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>《知情同意书》</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>附件</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>，手写签字并扫描电子版；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>身份证与学生证</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>身份证正反面扫描在同一</span><span>A4</span><span>页面文档内；学生证将个人信息页和注册信息页扫描在同一</span><span>A4</span><span>页面文档内</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span><span>本科期间成绩单</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>教务部门盖章</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span><span>个人简历；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.</span><span>英语成绩单复印件或</span></span><span><span>其他证明</span></span><span><span>（如大学英语四、六级考试成绩、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>成绩、雅思成绩、</span><span>GRE/GMAT</span><span>成绩）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7.</span><span>其他有关材料</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>获奖证书、本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>说明：入营资格将由广东工业大学信息工程学院根据申请</span></span><span><span>人在</span></span><span><span>网上提交的信息进行审核。审核结果将于</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>左右在学院官网公布。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>食宿及交通安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>交通：</span></span><span><span>参营人员</span></span><span><span>往返交通费自理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>食宿：</span></span><span><span>参营人员食宿由学院统一安排</span></span><span><span>，住宿时间：</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日（中午</span><span>12:00</span><span>后）―</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日（</span><span>12:00</span><span>前）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>保险：学院将统一为</span></span><span><span>参营人员</span></span><span><span>购买在广工活动期间的团体意外保险。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、注意事项</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>参营人员</span></span><span><span>必须遵守广东工业大学信息工程学院的相关规定，按照学院统一的安排参加各项活动，并注意安全；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>本次夏令营活动不收取任何费用；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>参营人员</span></span><span><span>报到后原则上要求全程参加夏令营活动，如有特殊情况，须及时请假，擅自离营者，将被取消资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span><span>未尽事宜以广东工业大学信息工程学院官方网站发布的相关通知为准，请及时关注。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>进一步详细信息可在</span></span><span><span>学院网站（</span><span>http://xxgcxy.gdut.edu.cn/</span><span>）查询，</span></span><span><span>可加入</span><span>QQ</span><span>群（</span><span>1079228403</span><span>）“广工信工</span><span>2026</span><span>年暑期夏令营，加群时备注为“夏令营报名</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>电话”后经审核入群，未尽事宜可工作日拨打电话</span><span>020-39329636</span><span>向张老师咨询。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>附件</span><span>1</span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span>《广东工业大学信息工程学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年（</span><span>2027</span><span>届）优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动申请表》</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件</span><span>2</span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span>《知情同意书》</span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>广东工业大学信息工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>20</span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"2b07dec1c33d8c9aed6caa601857c71cd7da401925c5eea6b8f3f2018bd51bf7","textLength":2494,"sourceSha256":"0660f97f1bd071c0fc725e4a2d97d2301f334a96d152ebebba1c8ad422108cb3","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1 广东工业大学信息工程学院2026年（2027届）优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表.doc","url":"https://xxgcxy.gdut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1839985821&wbfileid=B831B358CE8223ADE91DDBA4E91E7B63"},{"name":"附件2 知情同意书.docx","url":"https://xxgcxy.gdut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1839985821&wbfileid=0C71694E5A59727C74DFA0D5BE488D2B"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e744fd8dee9f76037553","title":"2026年广东工业大学信息工程学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:06.509991+00:00"}
